Bootstrap: docker
From: mambaorg/micromamba:1.5.8

%labels
    Maintainer refmb project
    Description refmb tier A — MGnify pipeline v5.0-equivalent assembly + annotation (metaSPAdes 3.15.3 w/ error correction | MEGAHIT 1.2.9; DIAMOND/UniRef90 2019_11; eggNOG-mapper 2.0.0; InterProScan 5.36-75.0 Pfam; KOfam KEGG 90; MGnify module completeness). Databases fetched separately (fetch_dbs.sh).

%files
    run_tierA.sh /opt/refmb/run_tierA.sh
    pv5_to_query.py /opt/refmb/pv5_to_query.py
    pv5_ref/tools_Assembly_KEGG_analysis_KEGG_pathways_give_pathways.py /opt/refmb/pv5_ref/tools_Assembly_KEGG_analysis_KEGG_pathways_give_pathways.py
    emapper2 /opt/refmb/emapper2

%post
    micromamba install -y -n base -c conda-forge -c bioconda \
        python=3.8 && micromamba create -y -n py27 -c conda-forge python=2.7 && micromamba create -y -n java8 -c conda-forge openjdk=8 && micromamba install -y -n base -c conda-forge -c bioconda \
        python=3.8 spades=3.15.3 megahit=1.2.9 prodigal=2.6.3 fraggenescan=1.31 diamond=0.9.25 hmmer=3.2.1 trimmomatic=0.36 bwa-mem2 samtools \
        networkx biopython pandas pyarrow curl && micromamba clean -a -y
    chmod +x /opt/refmb/run_tierA.sh

%environment
    export PATH=/opt/conda/bin:/opt/refmb:$PATH
    export REFMB_PY=/opt/conda/bin/python
    export SPADES_BIN=/opt/conda/bin
    export EMAPPER_PY=/opt/conda/envs/py27/bin/python
    export JAVA8_BIN=/opt/conda/envs/java8/bin

%runscript
    exec bash /opt/refmb/run_tierA.sh "$@"

%help
    refmb tier A container. Databases (~70 GB compressed) are not included: run fetch_dbs.sh <dbdir> once, unpack the
    .gz / InterProScan tarball there, then:
      apptainer run --bind <dbdir>:/dbs,<work>:/work refmb_tierA.sif --sample S --out /work/S --dbs /dbs --r1 /work/R1.fq.gz --r2 /work/R2.fq.gz
    Output /work/S/query is a refmb query directory: score it with `refmb normalize` + `refmb score` against a pipeline A bundle.
